---
profile: production

exclude_paths:
  - .cache/
  - .github/
  # ciphertext, not lintable YAML
  - group_vars/secret_vars

# Collections used by the roles need to be resolvable for schema/argument
# checks (e.g. linode.cloud modules) - installed in CI via collections.yml
# before this runs, so no offline/mock overrides needed here.

# Nothing in skip_list/warn_list yet on purpose: the production profile is
# expected to surface real findings against the current codebase (see PR
# discussion). Add specific rule IDs here only with a comment explaining why,
# not as a blanket way to get CI green.
